' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0002 State Registry - Abstract Team-Scoped Service Sequence

actor Operator
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Trusted API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Event Listener\n(one team)" as Listener
participant "Executor\n(one team + one tag)" as Executor
participant "State Registry" as State
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "OpenBao Transit" as OpenBao

== Listener task ingestion ==
Listener -> State : submit immutable team_id, source, source_task_id, required_tag, payload
State -> State : verify listener identity is authorized for submitted team_id
State -> DB : transactionally insert team-owned task + created event\ndedupe by (team_id, source, source_task_id)
State --> Listener : 201 created or 200 same-team existing task

== Executor registration and discovery ==
Executor -> State : register immutable team_id + exactly one tag\n+ type, metadata, capacity observations
State -> State : verify service binding matches team_id and one tag
State -> DB : persist one-team Executor
State --> Executor : 200 Executor record
Executor -> State : discover created tasks by registered team + exact tag
State -> DB : team predicate + tag predicate before page/count/cursor\n(read-only; no reservation; no capacity decision)
State --> Executor : same-team summaries or 204/empty\n(no foreign metadata)

== Atomic approval and ordered lifecycle ==
Executor -> State : request approval for task_id
State -> DB : atomic same-team + same-tag compare-and-set\nset immutable executor_id + approved_at\nappend dispatched(executor_id=NULL)
alt eligible same-team created task
  State --> Executor : 200 approved + environment_id + team-bound scope token
else same-team stale candidate
  State --> Executor : 409 task_already_dispatched
else foreign or unknown point identifier
  State --> Executor : non-revealing 404
end
Executor -> State : append running then finished|failed\n{executor_id, team_id=team-a, event_id,\nevent_type, occurred_at, payload}
State -> State : verify envelope team_id equals authenticated Executor team\nassigned same-team check; retry by event_id\nreject invalid/out-of-order; no accepted_sequence
State -> DB : append event + update projection in one transaction
State --> Executor : 202 original acceptance or rejection without append

== Informational Executor observations ==
Executor -> State : append self event\n{executor_id NOT NULL, team_id=team-a, event_id,\nevent_type, occurred_at, payload}
State -> State : verify envelope team_id equals authenticated Executor team
State -> DB : append same-team executor_event + mirror latest observations
State --> Executor : 202 accepted; observations never gate discovery/approval

== Trusted operator context and isolated reads ==
Operator -> UI : read state; manage controls, team environments, team secrets
UI -> Gateway : authenticated operator request
Gateway -> Gateway : check canonical operator team
Gateway -> State : trusted operator_id, team_id, request_id\n(optional display-only team_name when verified team carries one)
State -> State : authorize by team_id only
State -> DB : filter team_id before pagination, counts, cursors, aggregates
State --> Gateway : same-team state or non-revealing 404 for foreign point id
Gateway --> UI : response

== Team-isolated WebSocket ==
Gateway -> State : WebSocket upgrade with one verified team_id
State -> State : bind team at upgrade; filter before replay/cursor/fan-out/frame
State --> Gateway : only bound-team frames; foreign filters emit no signal

