Gateway -> State : same-team control or environment/secret write
State -> DB : enforce canonical team ownership + plaintext-free audit
State -> OpenBao : encrypt only authorized same-team secret writes
OpenBao --> State : ciphertext
State -> DB : persist logical secret + immutable referenced version
Executor -> State : open environment via
State -> State : GET /v1/environments/{environment_id}/open?task_id={task_id}
